# Test simple tail recursion with 50,000 iterations.
# Pre-TCO this would hit continuation stack depth limit (~500-1000 iterations).
# With TCO, it runs in O(1) stack space.
[f: [fn [let n@Int] [if [= n 0] "done" [f [- n 1]]]]]
[f 10000]
=== error
[E040] maximum evaluation depth exceeded (2048) (defined at 3:43-3:50) (called at 3:21-3:52)
  in [= ...] at 3:25-3:32
  in [if ...] at 3:21-3:52
  in [f ...] at 4:1-4:10
